# A Claude Code user with a read-only subagent (security-reviewer, tools
# restricted to Read+Bash) reviewing a file with an obvious command-
# injection bug, invoked through the model's task tool.
@real
@home scratch
@size 140x45
@fixture qa/fixtures/real/ext-agents

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 30
SEND /agents
WAIT 1
SHOT agents-list
EXPECT /security-reviewer/
KEY esc
SEND Use the security-reviewer agent to review app.py for security issues.
WAITFOR /Running a subagent|Running \d+ subagents/ 60
SHOT subagent-panel
IDLE 180
SHOT review-result
EXPECT /(?i)inject|os\.system|unsafe/
